  "$id": "gpuwm.certification-capsule/v1",
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "description": "One machine-readable run-identity receipt: the code, the resolved physics registry, the input bytes, the pinned numerical environment of docs/public/DETERMINISM.md section 3, the translation units the run compiled, the arithmetic contract, the run shape, the output frames with their trajectory digests, and the attached receipts.",
